translatedText:
Hey, let's actually increase the thickness of your arms. In this video, I'll tell you the three key movements, how long it will take, and a final tip to go from skinny arms to truly impressive ones.

I used to think push-ups would fix my skinny arms, until I discovered the exact arm exercises you need to gain real volume (based on pure biomechanics), even when you're wearing clothes.

My biggest recommendation isn't just doing the exercises and eating well (which largely determines whether you'll see results or not), but taking it seriously. That's why I encourage you to write down the day you start and come back when you see results, because there's no point in being motivated for a week if you're just going to quit.

Fun fact: I clarified that this content isn't AI-generated because there are so many automated videos out there these days, made by people who don't really know anything about the fitness world. That's why, in this video, I'll give you a thorough explanation of how you can truly build amazing arms. Another point to clarify is how the brachialis muscle looks in the video (hehe). It's actually a muscle hidden beneath the biceps (responsible for thickness, as I mentioned), but it appears that way in the video for clarity.

So don't put it off until tomorrow.

